ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL SOFTWARE

This Software places orders with a brokerage. It is provided for research and
educational purposes and is NOT investment advice. The authors are not
registered investment advisers, brokers, or dealers.

Trading involves substantial risk of loss. Automated trading can lose money
faster than manual trading, including through software defects, stale or
incorrect market data, broker outages, and unattended operation. Parameters in
this repository were fitted to a specific universe over a specific period and
carry no expectation of future performance.

You are solely responsible for any orders placed by software you run, whether
or not you were present. Test on a paper account. Read the risk code before
funding anything.
